      {
        "name": "Absorbitive biology",
        "description": "Your body is naturally capable of gaining power from those you can eat. You can eat a creature of medium size only if they are willing, unconcious, paralyzed, or otherwise incapacitated.\n\n- You learn all **Techniques**, **Trained Features**, and *Languages* of the assimilated. If the assimilated has more *Mastery Ranks* in a **Technique** that you know, you gain those *Mastery Ranks*.\n- If they have any **Ability Scores** higher than yours you may add +1 to those **Ability Scores**, this may increase it above your *Ability Score Maximum*.\n\t- If none of their **Ability Scores** surpass yours you gain +1 to whichever **Ability Score** was their highest.\n-\tYou gain visual quirks resembling the entities that you assimilated.\n- You gain the **Fusion Character Tag** and lose all benefits from this feature that you have gained if you ever lose this **Tag**, coughing up those you have assimilated if it is lost.\n\nYou may only gain this benefit a number of times equal to your *Constitution Modifier*.\n:\n\n\n\n\\page"
      }
